# Fail-Safe Images

- Use `Coil` (`AsyncImage`).
- NEVER use temporary design tool links, expired tokens, or `source.unsplash.com` (which returns 404).
- Use these guaranteed working, high-quality, lightweight URLs for Mock Data based on context:
  * Premium/Dark Abstract (Good for Crypto/Finance cards): `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80`
  * Tech/Data/Nodes: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1639762681485-074b7f938ba0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80`
  * Profile/Avatar/User: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535713875002-d1d0cf377fde?auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80`
  * Beach/Nature/Travel: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80`
- If additional unique images are needed, strictly use: `https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=[unique_number]`.
